# Backgrounds Folder

Store background images here.

## Files Example
- `bg_register.png` - Background for register page
- `bg_login.png` - Background for login page
- `bg_home.png` - Background for home page
- `bg_pattern.png` - Repeating pattern background

## Usage

```dart
Image.asset(
  'assets/images/backgrounds/bg_register.png',
  fit: BoxFit.cover,
)
```
